<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In From Global to Local: Learning Context-Aware Graph Representations for Document Classification and Summarization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Detailed GAT Results</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS1" title="In Appendix C Detailed GAT Results ‣ From Global to Local: Learning Context-Aware Graph Representations for Document Classification and Summarization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.1 </span>Independent T-Test Analyses</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In From Global to Local: Learning Context-Aware Graph Representations for Document Classification and Summarization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Investigation into Extractive Summarization</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS1" title="In Appendix D Investigation into Extractive Summarization ‣ From Global to Local: Learning Context-Aware Graph Representations for Document Classification and Summarization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.1 </span>Summary Sentence Distribution</span></a></li>
