<span id="A3.T11.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">BBC</span> graphs with different model variants in comparison to the full-attention ReLU baselines. <math id="A3.T11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0</annotation></semantics></math> refers to non-filtered graphs. Statistical significance is highlighted in <span id="A3.T11.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>.</figcaption>
</figure>
